anaka-san's reactions...!"},{"chara":[{"id":300201,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Natsuki","textRight":"Hinano-san's multiplying too!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300201},{"effect":"fadeout","id":101301}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300901,"motion":100,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Manaka","textRight":"More like everyone's reactions are rapidly@increasing!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"So they are...! This one's trouble..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":400,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"Why the hecky are they doing thiiis!?"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"If they disguise their magic power,@Magical Girls can't sense them."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"They're trying to quietly spread curses@and kill people."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"Or perhaps...they're using our magic to hide@the whereabouts of their Witch."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":820400,"motion":300,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Aru-chan","textRight":"＜××××!!＞"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300901,"motion":200,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Manaka","textRight":"Aru-chan's nodding her head a ton!"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"Then if we wipe out all the Familiars@hiding the Witch,"},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"we'll find out where she is?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":820400,"motion":400,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Aru-chan","textRight":"[chara:820400:effect_emotion_joy_0][se:7222_happy]＜××××!!＞"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":300201,"motion":100,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Natsuki","textLeft":"Seems like a really happy yes!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":820400},{"effect":"fadeout","id":300201}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":100,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"Awesooome!!"},{"chara":[{"id":300601}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"Myaako-senpai's deduction was like dead on!"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":100},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"Looks like we've finally reached@the decisive conclusion."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"First we'll split up and take out the Familiars!"},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"Beating all of them should naturally lead us@right to the Witch's true location."},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"Emiri, contact Kagome about this!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"Okay!"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":0}],"nameNarration":"","narration":"[surround:7105_telphone]～～♪～～♪@～～♪～～♪@～～♪～～♪","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21581.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Emiri","narrationEffect":"out","textRight":"Huh...what's going on here?@She's not picking up at all..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"What's wrong?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300601}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"I keep on calling her, but Kagomecchi's not@answering at all."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"That's strange... I told her we would contact her@if we learned anything."},{